<!--
Maintenance discipline (per heartbeat-concept SKILL.md):

1. END OF SESSION: open this file, describe what changed since the last entry,
   rewrite it with today's date and the new state. Bound to ~5 minutes of
   writing. If you can't say it in 5 minutes, your reflection is the wrong shape.

2. START OF SESSION (optional, higher-leverage if added): re-read this file
   before opening any project. Use it to set the day's focus.

3. WEEKLY (optional): review the past 7 days of edits to this file. Promote
   recurring patterns to CLAUDE.md rules. Prune stale entries from this file
   itself.
-->
